:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy unit, see [[Kagamine Rin & Len (Enemy)]].''
'''Kagamine Rin & Len''' are an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Hatsune Miku Collaboration Event]]. They were added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 537
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Kagamine Rin & Len
|name2 = Kagamine Rin & Len CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Kagamine Rin & Len CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Kagamine Rin and Len can help controlling Metal enemies with their slow and knockback ability since they have Area Attack which [[Hoop Cat (Rare Cat)|Hoop Cat]] and [[Clockwork Cat (Rare Cat)|Clockwork Cat]] both lack. Just make sure to provide them with proper support as they cannot reposition from [[Super Metal Hippoe]]'s knockback.

Against Dark enemies however, it is better to use [[Flower Cat (Special Cat)|Bombercat]], unless dealing with higher range enemies such as [[Le'noir]] and [[Dark Lazer (Enemy)|Dark Lazer]].

{{Job|Classification = Backliner & Crowd-Controller}}

